    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sale of three bedroom detached bungalow with lovely private gardens.\r\n\r\nDeceptively spacious modern three-bedroom detached bungalow situated in one of the most sought-after private quality residential developments in Arklow town, superbly located and well maintained, in excellent condition throughout offering a quite friendly neighborhood just off the sea road. Within a few minutes’ walk to North beach, swimming pool, leisure centre, Arklow Bay Hotel, shops, schools, churches, Bridgewater Shopping Centre, Arklow’s Main Street Shopping and all town amenities and facilities, and a short drive to the North exit of Arklow bypass.\r\n\r\nThis lovely home has three large bedrooms (Main En-Suite), great size lounge with open fireplace, kitchen and family bathroom. The property was constructed to high standards, insulated cavity walls, with red brick front, new double-glazed uPVC windows, maintenance free gutters and exterior.\r\n\r\nA lovely home in great location.\r\n\r\nNEGOTIATOR\r\n\r\nPETER MILLS PROPERTY\r\n19 Lower Main Street, Arklow, Co. Wicklow V14 V6P0\r\n\r\n0402 32911\r\n\r\ninfo@petermillsproperty.com"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALL\r\n7.60m x 1.38m\r\nTiled floor, airing cup board.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN / DINING ROOM\r\n5.66m x 3.99m\r\nNice bright kitchen with units at wall and floor level, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher.\r\nLovely bright kitchen, beautiful floor tiling, recessed lighting. Door to garden.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM\r\n5.34m x 4.05m\r\nA fine spacious room located to the front of the bungalow with large front window.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 (Master Bedroom)\r\n3.88m x 3.31m\r\nLocated to back of house, fitted wardrobes, telephone point.\r\n\r\nEn - Suite 2.2m x 1.27m\r\nComprising shower cubicle with power shower, tiled cubicle, tiled floor, part tiled walls, with whc, wc nice wall shelves, shaving light.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2\r\n3.16m x 2.35m\r\nFitted wardrobes, telephone point.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3\r\n3.17m x 3.03m\r\nLocated to front of house. Fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nFAMILY BATHROOM\r\n2.07m x 1.95m\r\nComprising bath with telephone shower attachment over bath and shower door, wc and whb. Tiled floor, shaving light.\r\n\r\nStira stairs to spacious attic fully floored, great space for storage.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\n\r\nNeat front garden in lawn incorporating parking area. Off street Parking.\r\n\r\nPedestrian access to rear sunny garden, with nice paving and hedging all round, very private garden to sit down and enjoy the sunshine on those lazy summer days.\r\n\r\nBlock built barbecue stand,nice garden shed 2.97m x 2.45m. Tiled floor and electric laid on.\r\n\r\nOutdoor tap for easy gardening.\r\n\r\nServices: Mains electricity, water and sewage. Oil fired radiator type central heating. Fibre optic broadband and cctv.\r\n\r\n25 LOVELY BUNGALOW IN GREAT LOCATION WITH ALL TOWN AMENITIES CLOSE BY"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tA lovely spacious 3 bed detached bungalow c. 97.49 m2        \r\n        (c. 1049.37 ft2).\r\n\r\n•\tSpacious detached property in an extremely sought-after residential area of town\r\n  \r\n•\tEnclosed private paved rear garden\r\n\r\n•\tSmall garden shed \r\n\r\n•\tModern design home and Low maintenance exterior\r\n\r\n•\tOff street parking\r\n\r\n•\tPedestrian side access to rear sunny garden with patio area where you can sit and enjoy summer days\r\n\r\n•\tExcellent location, short stroll to schools, shops, supermarkets, commuter bus and all town amenities. Numerous sporting activities\r\n\r\n•\tA few minutes’ drive from Exit 21 (Arklow South) onto M11 motorway. Less than an hour’s drive to Dublin\r\n\r\n•\tuPVC windows and doors\r\n\r\n•\tFibre optic broadband available in the area."
      },
